we can use Pure C# Html Helper
it has 2 ways to achieve the same
1. @Html.TextBoxFor() -> Strongly type it takes lambda expresion to bind model property 
2. @Html.TextBox()   -> Loosely(weakly) typed (it takes string to bind model property ) 
